Q3635669 | arts, religion | east | The Mukteshvara Temple in Bhubaneswar, Odisha, is a 10th-century Hindu temple dedicated to Shiva, dating to 950–975 CE. | The Mukteshvara Temple in Bhubaneswar is a small, finely carved temple more than 1,000 years old.
