Q14624218 | power | deccan | The Western Chalukya Empire ruled most of the western Deccan between the 10th and 12th centuries. | The Western Chalukya kings ruled the western Deccan for about 200 years.
Q2365530 | arts, religion | east | The Lingaraja Temple, dedicated to Shiva, is one of the oldest temples in Bhubaneswar, the capital of Odisha. | The Lingaraja Temple is one of the oldest and biggest temples in the city of Bhubaneswar.
