Q916943 | arts, religion, technology | south | The Brihadisvara Temple at Thanjavur, called Rajarajesvaram by its builder, is a Shaivite Hindu temple in the Chola style. | The Chola king Rajaraja built a giant temple to Shiva at Thanjavur. People call it the Big Temple.
