Q5521034 | arts, religion | south | The Brihadisvara Temple at Gangaikonda Cholapuram in Tamil Nadu, dedicated to Shiva, was completed in 1035. | A Chola king built a second giant Shiva temple at his new capital. It was finished in 1035.
